  "body": "Being sold with valuable car park - this is a perfect home, investment or bolt hole!\r\nWith glittering panoramic views from the CBD all the way to the West, you'll just love living here.\r\nSee it all come to life as the sun sets with the City lights and the Waitakere sunset putting on dazzling show for you.\r\n \r\nThis gorgeous one bedroom apartment with car park is the perfect lock up and leave and you have secure living with 24 hour reception.\r\nThe complex has an onsite restaurant, bar, TV and library and excellent recreation facilities with gymnasium, spa pool, swimming pool and tennis court.\r\nOnly a few minutes' walk and you are in the centre of Takapuna with all its boutiques, restaurants, cafes and bars and it is only a short stroll down to the Takapuna Beach.\r\nThe property offers an excellent return, or you can move in and enjoy a secure lifestyle in one of the hottest suburbs of the city.\r\nDon't delay, call James Mairs now for an appointment to view.",
